{"tool_id": "context7::resolve-library-id", "enriched_text": "This tool resolves a package or product name to a Context7-compatible library ID, returning the most relevant matching libraries based on various criteria. Use this tool when a user needs to obtain a valid Context7-compatible library ID for a specific package or product name. library resolve ID Context7 package", "method": "llm"}
