{"tool_id": "desktop-commander::read_file", "enriched_text": "This tool reads the contents of a specified file from the file system or a URL, allowing for optional parameters to control the starting point and number of lines retrieved. It supports reading text files and displaying recognized image formats. Use this tool when there is a need to access and view the contents of a file or image from a specified path or URL. file system read URL offset length", "method": "llm"}
