{"tool_id": "google-maps::GOOGLE_MAPS_DISTANCE_MATRIX_API", "enriched_text": "This tool calculates travel distances and times for multiple origins and destinations, accommodating various modes of transportation and specific timing options. Use this tool when needing to determine travel metrics for a set of locations based on different transportation methods. transportation calculate distance time routing", "method": "llm"}
