{"tool_id": "google-maps::GOOGLE_MAPS_GET_DIRECTION", "enriched_text": "This tool fetches detailed directions between an origin and a destination, allowing for intermediate waypoints and various travel modes. Use this tool when needing to obtain navigation directions for a specific route. navigation fetch directions waypoints travel", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "google-maps::GOOGLE_MAPS_TEXT_SEARCH", "enriched_text": "This tool searches for locations on Google Maps based on a textual query, allowing users to find specific places such as restaurants or landmarks. This tool is used when a user wants to locate places by entering descriptive text. geolocation search textQuery maxResultCount fieldMask", "method": "llm"}
