{"tool_id": "notion::notion-search", "enriched_text": "This tool performs searches within a Notion workspace and connected sources, allowing users to find documents and users based on specific queries and filters. It supports both semantic and workspace-only search modes, optimizing results based on user access. Use this tool when needing to locate specific documents or users within a Notion workspace or its connected sources. search filter workspace documents users", "method": "llm"}
