{"tool_id": "pubmed::search_articles", "enriched_text": "This tool searches the PubMed database for biomedical and life sciences research articles that match a specified query, allowing users to retrieve relevant literature. Use this tool when searching for research articles in the fields of medicine, biology, or related life sciences. biomedical search query literature articles", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "alchemy::fetchTokenPriceHistoryBySymbol", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves the historical price data of a specified token over a defined time range, allowing users to analyze price trends at specified intervals. Use this tool when needing to obtain historical price information for a specific token between two dates. blockchain retrieve historical data token price", "method": "llm"}
