{"tool_id": "clinicaltrialsgov-mcp-server::clinicaltrials_get_study", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves one or more clinical studies from ClinicalTrials.gov using their NCT IDs, providing either detailed study data or brief summaries. This tool is used when a user needs to access information about specific clinical studies identified by their NCT IDs. clinical trials fetch NCT IDs data retrieval summaries", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "clinicaltrialsgov-mcp-server::clinicaltrials_list_studies", "enriched_text": "This tool searches for clinical studies by utilizing a combination of query terms and filters, allowing users to retrieve relevant study information efficiently. It supports pagination, sorting, and geographic filtering to refine search results. Use this tool when needing to find specific clinical studies based on defined search criteria. clinical research search filter pagination geographic", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "clinicaltrialsgov-mcp-server::clinicaltrials_analyze_trends", "enriched_text": "This tool performs statistical analysis on clinical trial data, aggregating results based on various criteria such as status, country, sponsor, or phase. Users can refine their analysis by applying specific query parameters to filter the included studies. This tool is used when a user needs to analyze trends in clinical trial data across multiple dimensions. clinical trials analyze data aggregation statistical analysis filtering", "method": "llm"}
