{"tool_id": "ddg-search::fetch_content", "enriched_text": "Fetches and parses content from a specified webpage URL, extracting relevant information for further processing. This tool is used when there is a need to retrieve and analyze content from a specific webpage. web fetch parse content URL", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "e2b-server::run_code", "enriched_text": "Executes Python code within a secure sandbox environment using Jupyter Notebook syntax. This tool is used when there is a need to run Python code safely without affecting the host system. Python execute sandbox Jupyter code", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "google-workspace::list_events", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves a list of upcoming calendar events within a specified time range and limits the number of results returned. Use this tool when needing to view scheduled events in a defined timeframe. calendar retrieve events time range results limit", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "lara-translate::translate", "enriched_text": "This tool translates text between languages, incorporating language detection, context-aware translations, and translation memories. Users utilize this tool when they need to convert text from one language to another while considering context and previous translations. language translate context text memory", "method": "llm"}
