{"tool_id": "mcp-code-executor::execute_code", "enriched_text": "Executes Python code within the venv-uv environment, specifically designed for short code snippets. This tool is used when a user needs to run brief Python code directly in a controlled environment. Python execute code venv-uv environment", "method": "llm"}
