{"tool_id": "osm-mcp-server::get_route_directions", "enriched_text": "This tool calculates detailed route directions between two geographic points, providing turn-by-turn navigation based on the specified transportation mode. It delivers information about distance, duration, maneuvers, and route geometry. Use this tool when planning a trip or needing navigation assistance between two locations. navigation calculate route directions transportation", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "osm-mcp-server::find_ev_charging_stations", "enriched_text": "This tool locates electric vehicle charging stations within a specified distance from a given location, allowing users to filter results by connector type and minimum power delivery. Users employ this tool when planning trips or assessing potential charging stops for electric vehicles. electric vehicles locate charging stations filter infrastructure", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "osm-mcp-server::analyze_neighborhood", "enriched_text": "This tool generates a detailed analysis of a neighborhood by evaluating various livability factors such as amenities, transportation options, and green spaces. It provides scores and metrics to assess the quality and convenience of a residential area. Users utilize this tool when they need to evaluate the livability of a neighborhood for real estate decisions or relocation planning. neighborhood analysis livability evaluation metrics", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "twelvedata::GetTimeSeries", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves metadata and time series data for a specified instrument, including price information and volume for non-currency instruments, organized in descending order by time. Use this tool when needing detailed historical price data and metadata for a specific financial instrument. finance retrieve time series metadata price data", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "twelvedata::GetTimeSeriesRsi", "enriched_text": "This tool calculates the Relative Strength Index (RSI), a momentum oscillator that evaluates the speed and change of price movements to assist in identifying potential overbought or oversold conditions and trend reversals. Users utilize this tool when they need to analyze market conditions for trading decisions based on momentum indicators. finance calculate momentum price indicator", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "twelvedata::GetTimeSeriesMacd", "enriched_text": "This tool calculates the Moving Average Convergence Divergence (MACD), a momentum indicator that assesses the difference between two moving averages and includes a signal line for identifying potential trend reversals and trading opportunities. Users utilize this tool when they need to analyze market trends and identify trading signals based on moving averages. finance calculate momentum trading indicator", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "twelvedata::GetSymbolSearch", "enriched_text": "This method identifies the most relevant financial symbol based on user-defined criteria, returning results in descending order of relevance. This tool is used when a user needs to find a specific financial instrument or symbol that matches particular search parameters. finance search symbols lookup relevance", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "twelvedata::GetCryptocurrencies", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves an updated array of cryptocurrencies available through the Twelve Data API, providing users with current market options. Use this tool when needing to access the latest list of cryptocurrencies for analysis or integration. finance retrieve cryptocurrency market data", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "weather::find_weather_stations", "enriched_text": "This tool identifies weather observation stations located near a specified location in the United States, providing access to station-specific data and sources for weather information. Use this tool when needing to locate weather stations to gather localized weather data. weather find location data stations", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "weather-data::weather_history", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves historical weather data for a specified location on a given date, providing users with detailed weather information from the past. Use this tool when needing to access weather conditions for a specific location and date for research or analysis. weather retrieve historical location date", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "weather-data::weather_astronomy", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves astronomy data, including sunrise, sunset, and moon information, for a specified location and date. Use this tool when needing to obtain astronomical events for a particular date and location. astronomy retrieve location date sunrise", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "weather-data::weather_search", "enriched_text": "This tool searches for locations that match a specified query, returning relevant weather data in JSON format. Use this tool when needing to find weather information for a specific location based on a user-provided query. weather search location query data", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "whois::whois_domain", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves WHOIS information for a specified domain, providing details about its registration and ownership. Use this tool when needing to gather registration details about a specific domain. domain lookup registration information whois", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "wikipedia::search_wikipedia", "enriched_text": "This tool searches Wikipedia for articles that match a specified query and retrieves a limited number of results. Use this tool when needing to find relevant Wikipedia articles based on a specific search term. knowledge search query retrieve articles", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "wikipedia::get_article", "enriched_text": "Retrieves the complete content of a specified Wikipedia article based on its title. This tool is used when a user needs to access detailed information from a specific Wikipedia entry. wikipedia retrieve content article title", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "wikipedia::get_summary", "enriched_text": "This tool retrieves a concise summary of a specified Wikipedia article based on its title. Use this tool when a brief overview of a topic from Wikipedia is needed. information retrieval summarization Wikipedia article title", "method": "llm"}
{"tool_id": "wikipedia::extract_key_facts", "enriched_text": "This tool extracts key facts from a specified Wikipedia article, allowing users to focus on a particular topic within the article and control the number of facts retrieved. This tool is used when a user needs concise information on a specific topic from a Wikipedia article. information retrieval extract Wikipedia facts topic", "method": "llm"}
